msgstr ""
"Guidedog toma como referencia el uso de Sphinx: una estructura conocida, "
"reStructuredText y MyST Markdown, los mismos nombres de configuración y "
"variables Jinja de estilo Sphinx."

#: ../../howto/migrate.rst:8
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "However, there is an essential architectural difference: Sphinx "
#| "executes arbitrary Python code in ``conf.py`` and relies on a Python "
#| "virtual environment with external packages. Guidedog, by contrast, "
