#| msgid ""
#| "On filesystems with directory exchange, the output path switches in "
#| "one operation. The fallback uses two renames and can briefly leave "
#| "that path absent. It still never exposes a partly assembled tree. "
#| "Journal recovery finishes or restores an interrupted switch. A client "
#| "making several requests can span two generations; the build does not "
